//@ filecheck:
// Each trailer is listed under the contract it belongs to, in offset order. `C` embeds
// `Child` twice, through `new Child()` and `type(Child).runtimeCode`, so `Child` has two
// entries before `C`'s own; `D` embeds `C` and keeps the owners of `C`'s trailers.
// Offsets point past the `INVALID` byte and do not move when the library placeholder is
// linked or the immutable is set.
// CHECK-LABEL: "Child": {
// CHECK: "cborAuxdata": {
// CHECK-NEXT: "A.sol:Child": [
// CHECK-NEXT: {
// CHECK-NEXT: "offset": 33,
